<title>JORDAN: Jordan bank deposits up 0.23 pct in Aug vs July.</title>
<headline>Jordan bank deposits up 0.23 pct in Aug vs July.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's bank deposits, both local and foreign currency accounts, rose 0.23 percent in August to 5.973 billion dinars ($8.4 billion) compared to the previous month, the Central Bank's latest statistical bulletin showed.</p>
<p>(All figures in million of dinars)</p>
<p>			  Aug 1996  July 1996  Aug 1995  1995   1994</p>
<p>    Total Assets    8,743     8,715	8,058     8,430  7,528</p>
<p>    Total deposits  5,973     5,959	5,674     5,788  5,392</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits:</p>
<p>			  2,367     2,318	2,153     2,255  1,966</p>
<p>NOTE -- The figures cover Jordan's 21 licensed banks including six investment banks and five subsidiaries of foreign banks operating under similar Central Bank rules.</p>
<p>$1=0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
